<<<BEGIN FILE wholesale-core/src/main/java/jp/co/tsubame/wholesale/service/OrderService.java>>>
[A1の完全な29357 bytesをそのまま配置]
<<<END FILE wholesale-core/src/main/java/jp/co/tsubame/wholesale/service/OrderService.java>>>
